# Secrets. .env.local holds the Supabase service_role key and the model API
# keys; service_role bypasses RLS entirely, so a committed copy would be a
# full database compromise rather than a data leak. *.example is the tracked
# template and is allowed through on purpose.
.env*
!.env*.example
